<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Moments · 叶枫影</title><description>生活的片段。照片、音乐与随笔。</description><link>https://leafvmaple.com/</link><language>zh-CN</language><item><title>为什么是听枫阁</title><link>https://leafvmaple.com/posts/start-here/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://leafvmaple.com/posts/start-here/</guid><description>一个写给几年后翻回来还能记得当时是什么样子的地方。不追阅读，不追热度。</description><pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>随笔</category></item><item><title>甲辰年冬月，初见金字塔</title><link>https://leafvmaple.com/posts/egypt-2024-day1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://leafvmaple.com/posts/egypt-2024-day1/</guid><description>从广州飞了一夜，赶在年末到开罗。下午到吉萨高地 —— 大金字塔就那么直接立在城市边缘的沙石上。（这趟的正文还在整理，先放一张占个位。）</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Dec 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>旅行</category><category>开罗</category><category>吉萨</category><category>金字塔</category><category>埃及</category></item><item><title>癸卯年二月，再访外伶仃</title><link>https://leafvmaple.com/posts/lingding-2023/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://leafvmaple.com/posts/lingding-2023/</guid><description>一年又来。3/4 跟另一拨同伴 —— 黄昏的弯月雕塑、海上日落的 Live Photo、夜里的海鲜市场跟烤肠；3/5 翡翠湖拍下学名石碑「矿石湖」+ 山顶花岗岩 + 红柱亭、傍晚船回珠海。</description><pubDate>Sat, 04 Mar 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>旅行</category><category>珠海</category><category>外伶仃岛</category><category>广东</category></item><item><title>壬寅年三月，外伶仃</title><link>https://leafvmaple.com/posts/lingding-2022/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://leafvmaple.com/posts/lingding-2022/</guid><description>疫情第三年的春天 —— 两天上岛。4/3 中午珠海港吃顿日料、下午船到 外伶仃 —— 南湾的海岸 + 弯月雕塑 + 礁石 + 夜街；4/4 山里翡翠湖 + 山顶鸟瞰 + 临走一杯精酿、傍晚船回珠海吃小龙虾。</description><pubDate>Sun, 03 Apr 2022 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>旅行</category><category>珠海</category><category>外伶仃岛</category><category>广东</category></item><item><title>庚子年正月，东京一日</title><link>https://leafvmaple.com/posts/tokyo/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://leafvmaple.com/posts/tokyo/</guid><description>新干线把 500 公里压成两个半小时；秋叶原把所有二次元粉丝想要的东西压成八层楼。从大阪到东京，是从「慢板」走到「极致细分」。</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Feb 2020 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>旅行</category><category>东京</category><category>日本</category></item><item><title>庚子年正月，京都一日</title><link>https://leafvmaple.com/posts/kyoto-winter/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://leafvmaple.com/posts/kyoto-winter/</guid><description>半天岚山，半天伏见。早上的灰、下午的红，被一条 JR 京都线连成一句话。</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jan 2020 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>旅行</category><category>京都</category><category>日本</category></item><item><title>庚子年正月，大阪一日</title><link>https://leafvmaple.com/posts/osaka/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://leafvmaple.com/posts/osaka/</guid><description>一座一千多万人的都会，正月里却像一首慢板。护城河的水是绿的，天守阁的金箔是新的，松屋的牛丼是热的 —— 大阪不动声色地把「古」和「今」叠在一起。</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jan 2020 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>旅行</category><category>大阪</category><category>日本</category></item><item><title>乙未年腊月，落地南非</title><link>https://leafvmaple.com/posts/south-africa-2016-day1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://leafvmaple.com/posts/south-africa-2016-day1/</guid><description>公司年度团的南非第一天 —— 约堡落地，大巴往西北开两个钟头。路过铁皮屋的 township，也路过 1979 年硬造在灌木丛里的太阳城 —— 同一段历史的两头。入夜住进比林斯堡保护区边上的 Bakubung，真正的草原还在窗外的黑暗里。</description><pubDate>Sun, 17 Jan 2016 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>旅行</category><category>约翰内斯堡</category><category>太阳城</category><category>比林斯堡</category><category>南非</category></item><item><title>甲午年腊月，京都到大阪</title><link>https://leafvmaple.com/posts/kyoto-osaka-2015/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://leafvmaple.com/posts/kyoto-osaka-2015/</guid><description>一天扫两座城。早上京都跑西本愿寺、平安神宫、锦市场附近一家定食店、路过 1927 年的市役所；午后大巴南下大阪城、撞见一场园区庙会；黄昏滑进心斋桥拱廊。</description><pubDate>Wed, 28 Jan 2015 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>旅行</category><category>京都</category><category>大阪</category><category>日本</category></item><item><title>甲午年腊月，小樽到神户</title><link>https://leafvmaple.com/posts/hokkaido-2015-day2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://leafvmaple.com/posts/hokkaido-2015-day2/</guid><description>北海道的最后一天 —— 上午从定山溪出发跑了小樽：运河、八音盒堂、蒸气钟、六花亭，一袋伴手礼塞满。傍晚飞神户落地，住进了一间仿荷兰国立美术馆的城堡式酒店。</description><pubDate>Tue, 27 Jan 2015 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>旅行</category><category>小樽</category><category>神户</category><category>北海道</category><category>日本</category></item><item><title>甲午年腊月，札幌出发的一整天</title><link>https://leafvmaple.com/posts/hokkaido-2015-day1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://leafvmaple.com/posts/hokkaido-2015-day1/</guid><description>北海道行程的第一整天。札幌凌晨醒来出发，跑了登别地狱谷、昭和新山、洞爷湖；半夜回到定山溪温泉旅馆，第一次泡日式露天，看到了温泉街那头的烟火。</description><pubDate>Mon, 26 Jan 2015 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>旅行</category><category>札幌</category><category>登别</category><category>洞爷湖</category><category>定山溪</category><category>北海道</category><category>日本</category></item><item><title>甲午年腊月，东京到札幌</title><link>https://leafvmaple.com/posts/tokyo-2015-day2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://leafvmaple.com/posts/tokyo-2015-day2/</guid><description>东京最后一天。同事去银座购物，自由活动那一小时偷溜去皇居跑了一圈。晚上从羽田起飞 —— 落地的札幌是雪、是夜灯。</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Jan 2015 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>旅行</category><category>东京</category><category>札幌</category><category>日本</category></item><item><title>甲午年腊月，东京一日</title><link>https://leafvmaple.com/posts/tokyo-2015/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://leafvmaple.com/posts/tokyo-2015/</guid><description>一天东京 —— 东京塔下数得出十个足球场；秋叶原把动漫社攒了四年的影子一次还清；都厅展望台看夜色铺到没边。</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Jan 2015 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>旅行</category><category>东京</category><category>日本</category></item><item><title>甲午年腊月，往返</title><link>https://leafvmaple.com/posts/travel-bookend-2015/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://leafvmaple.com/posts/travel-bookend-2015/</guid><description>七天日本的两端 —— 1/23 珠海湾的日出、HKG 候机、ANA 直飞成田；1/29 KIX 国际线 ゲート、回 HKG、回家。中间七天另成各帖。</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Jan 2015 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>旅行</category><category>珠海</category><category>香港</category><category>东京</category><category>大阪</category><category>日本</category></item></channel></rss>